  "body": "Part of #140, compare-and-branch CB-9. This PR combines CB-8 (computed operands) with the T7b-9 argument-passing loops and adds computed first operands to the zero and imm12 forms. The exact `runtests/fibonacci.clif` function is now proved.\n\n- Zero form with a computed x (`StockComparisonZeroComputed{Selection,Facts,Values,Cores}`): `comparison_selected_zero_computed` and `Calls.comparison_zero_computed_emission`, which emits exactly one `cbz`/`cbnz` on x's register. Exclusions:\n  - `NonConstantSource x` excludes `emit_icmp` 5171/5173.\n  - `cc = ne \u2228 NonBandSource x` excludes tbz 3257.\n  - `is_nonzero` survey: 4977/4979 take any value; the overflow-flag rules are unreachable under `MappedCtxInv`; no rule looks through `band` or `icmp`.\n- Imm12 form with a computed x (`StockComparisonImmComputed*`): `comparison_selected_imm_computed`. `k \u2260 0` for eq/ne excludes tbz.\n- Metadata layers `ComputedArgsMetadata \u2283 ComputedZeroMetadata \u2283 ComputedMetadata`, with the carry compositions with arguments `returning/trapping_selected_computed(_zero|_args)_carry_below`.\n- Selector `ComparisonComputedArgsLoopCfg` and its class, return, trap, domain and check files:\n  - `domainAt_of_computed_args_loop_cfg : Scalar.DomainAt f`.\n  - `source_ok_sound`.\n  - `check_sound : check f vc = true \u2192 Scalar.CodeDomain f vc`, on the split code.\n- Witnesses (each has one marked `native_decide`):\n  - `fibonacci_witness` covers file lines 12\u201344 exactly, and the literal equals `Clif.parseFile` with its `runs`.\n    - It gives `Scalar.DomainAt`.\n    - Every `; run:` line holds in the source semantics.\n    - `fib(10)` returns 55.\n    - The earlier classes (T7b-7/8/9, CB-8) reject the function.\n    - The lowering has the edge node `edge 2 1 2` and is not legacy-compatible.\n    - The split code has a 32-bit `cbz`, `check` accepts it, and `Scalar.CodeDomain` holds.\n  - `count_to_witness`: the computed register form with arguments.\n  - `count_below_witness`: `icmp ult (iadd v1, 1), 10`, which lowers to `subs wzr, #10; b.lo`.\n\nNew files only, unwired. Gates: the build passes (1165/1165). The audits pass: `comparison-zero-computed` (15/15), `comparison-imm-computed` (13/13) and `comparison-computed-args` (43/43).\n\n\ud83e\udd16 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n",
